WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:19.250 --> 00:00:20.125
Sara!

00:00:26.458 --> 00:00:27.541
Awesome!

00:00:29.875 --> 00:00:30.958
Let's do it again!

00:00:34.708 --> 00:00:38.625
Sara! I have told you many times
to stop doing that.

00:00:39.041 --> 00:00:42.208
It's all right. PJ will always catch me.

00:00:42.291 --> 00:00:44.291
-You'll get hurt.
-I'll get repaired.

00:00:44.375 --> 00:00:46.291
You are human.

00:00:46.375 --> 00:00:51.041
When you broke your arm,
it took months for it to get repaired.

00:00:51.125 --> 00:00:53.958
-You must not--
-E92, shush! Mute!

00:00:54.666 --> 00:00:55.541
Sara!

00:01:08.166 --> 00:01:09.541
This needs to be fixed!

00:01:10.583 --> 00:01:13.291
Affirmative. I'll give you a cool arm.

00:01:13.708 --> 00:01:17.541
Uncle John, got a module?
I want to fix PJ.

00:01:35.208 --> 00:01:36.375
What is this place?

00:02:02.291 --> 00:02:04.750
-What was that place?
-Enough of that.

00:02:04.958 --> 00:02:06.666
-Why?
-It's dangerous.

00:02:06.791 --> 00:02:08.833
-How?
-It just is.

00:02:08.916 --> 00:02:10.291
I want to go there!

00:02:10.375 --> 00:02:12.041
-No!
-Why?

00:02:12.500 --> 00:02:16.666
I'm not jumping off anything,
and I'm not going to get hurt.

00:02:16.750 --> 00:02:20.041
-So, why is it dangerous? Why?
-Wait!

00:02:20.375 --> 00:02:23.541
Expanding language function.
Sharing completed.

00:02:24.416 --> 00:02:27.458
Nobody should know
that a human lives here.

00:02:27.541 --> 00:02:28.583
Didn't I tell you?

00:02:28.750 --> 00:02:34.000
Many of the robots that live outside
believe humans are evil.

00:02:34.208 --> 00:02:38.416
If Sara is found,
Sara's life will be in danger.

00:02:38.500 --> 00:02:40.791
Affirm you won't put yourself in danger.

00:02:41.333 --> 00:02:44.250
-But--
-No, Sara! Affirm!

00:02:45.791 --> 00:02:47.083
Sara, watch your mouth!

00:02:47.166 --> 00:02:51.291
Not again! I'm the only one
who's not allowed to do anything!

00:02:51.375 --> 00:02:52.375
Sara!

